      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَوْبٌ صُحَارِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>A kind of garment, so called in
relation to</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُحَار</span>, <i>a town of El-Yemen:</i> or, as
some say, <i>of the colour termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُحْرَة</span>, like ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْحَرُ</span></b> .
